  <p>This policy explains how TechTide SEO ("we") handles personal information collected through techtideseo.com.</p>
  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>TechTide SEO, 2A Iyalla Street, Alausa, Ikeja, Lagos, Nigeria. Contact: info@techtideseo.com.</p>
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><b>Information you send us</b>: your name, email, website address, country and message when you use our audit or contact forms.</li>
    <li><b>Analytics data</b>: only if you accept analytics cookies, such as pages viewed, device type and approximate location.</li>
    <li><b>Technical data</b>: standard server logs such as IP address and browser type, kept by our hosting provider for security and reliability.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To reply to your enquiry and prepare your audit.</li>
    <li>To understand and improve the website (analytics, with your consent).</li>
    <li>To keep the site secure and prevent spam.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Legal bases</h2>
  <p>Where data protection law requires a legal basis, we rely on your consent (analytics cookies), taking steps at your request before an agreement (replying to enquiries and audits) and our legitimate interests (security and improving our service), as permitted under the Nigeria Data Protection Act 2023.</p>
  <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
  <p>We use service providers to run the site: form handling (Formspree), hosting and delivery (Cloudflare), and, only if you accept analytics, Google Analytics and Microsoft Clarity. We do not sell personal information.</p>
  <h2>International transfers</h2>
  <p>Some providers may process data outside your country. Where required, we rely on appropriate safeguards, such as the providers' standard contractual clauses and data processing agreements, in line with the Nigeria Data Protection Act 2023.</p>
  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>Enquiry data is kept for 12 months after our last contact unless we need it longer to meet legal obligations. Analytics data is kept according to the settings of the analytics provider.</p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct, delete or export your personal information, to object to or restrict certain uses, to withdraw consent at any time and to complain to the Nigeria Data Protection Commission (NDPC) or your local data protection authority. Contact us at info@techtideseo.com to exercise these rights.</p>
  <h2>Security and children</h2>
  <p>We use reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect personal information. Our services are for businesses and are not directed at children.</p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy. The date at the top shows when it was last changed.</p>
</Legal>
